  "headline": "Mesalamine 0.375 g capsules are not on FDA's shortage list; supply at Corvale East is 5.5 days and a transfer from Corvale Lakeside can raise it to 8 days",
  "headline_cites": ["D4", "D1", "D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list shows mesalamine is not listed as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 49 capsules at 9 per day, giving 5.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 50 capsules at 1.8 per day, giving 27.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 24 capsules from Corvale Lakeside to Corvale East, which would leave Lakeside with 14 days and raise East to 8 days.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "All three Corvale sites use the same NDC 70771162507 labeled by Zydus Lifesciences Limited.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for that NDC names Zydus Lifesciences Limited as the registered plant (FEI 3007938603) with a VAI inspection on 2023-03-24.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E8"]
    }
  ]
}
